<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Adaptive icon foreground — Concept 1 mark, scaled into the safe zone.

  Adaptive icons are 108dp but only the central 66dp circle is guaranteed
  visible under every OEM mask. The frame is therefore 50x50 centred at
  (54,54): its half-diagonal is 35.4, and because the corners carry a 9dp
  radius the true extent stays inside the safe circle on circular masks.

  Single flat colour, one evenOdd path — so this doubles as the monochrome
  (themed icon) layer without modification.
-->
